 | Setting | Value | Meaning |
 |---|---|---|
-| `validate.result` | `list of messages` | `validate()` returns one `<field>: <problem>` string per problem, or an empty list |
-| `validate.reports` | `first problem` | validation stops at the first problem it finds |
+| `validate.result` | `list of (field, message) pairs` | `validate()` returns one pair per problem, or an empty list; `field` is `expression` for a problem with the whole expression |
+| `validate.reports` | `every problem` | every field is checked, and each field with a problem gives one pair |
 
